1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,486
Watch what happens as the angle changes.

2
00:00:02,486 --> 00:00:07,656
At ninety degrees the moment arm is longest and the torque is greatest.

3
00:00:07,656 --> 00:00:11,914
Push straight along r, and the moment arm shrinks to zero.

4
00:00:11,914 --> 00:00:13,033
No torque at all.

